<title>GERMANY: Kaufring sales down in 1996.</title>
<headline>Kaufring sales down in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>DUESSELDORF, Germany 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year 1996.</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group business volume		2,900	 vs 3,100</p>
<p>    Of which ordinary turnover	 1,400	 vs 1,400</p>
<p>		 direct sales:	     1,600	 vs 1,700</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German retailer is Kaufring AG. The company said its results were preliminary and did not include value-added tax. Figures do not add up due to rounding.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
</text>
